{% comment %}
  Won Discounts — sale badge (MVP 5, Výprodej; contract O9, docs/plans/2026-10-02-won-discounts-mvp5.md).
  App block, product template only. Reads the product metafield `outlet` the sale writes:
  {"d": display, "v": {"<variant numeric id>": pieces left}, "e": {"<variant numeric id>": end, epoch seconds}}
  (absent = nothing on sale; `e` only for a sale with an end date).
  A sale whose badge the merchant hid for its variant is simply not in `v` (the app leaves it out).
  - silent / strike: nothing here (the theme strikes compare_at_price itself);
  - strike_badge: "Výprodej"; strike_badge_left: + "Zbývá X ks" (X > 0, the real quota).
  One row per sale variant, and only the row of the variant the shopper has picked is shown (feedback 9 Oct 2026,
  3rd round, bod 6: every sale variant listed by name read as "Sale 400 g" and said nothing). Liquid shows the
  variant the page was rendered for; assets/won-discounts-blocks.js follows the shopper's pick (loaded only for a
  product with more variants, or a sale with a countdown). A variant that is not on sale shows no badge.
  Never reads or changes the cart (SF-1). Markers data-won-discounts-outlet*.
  The looks with a countdown (the storefront config's `appearance.oc`; the look itself is CSS in the config's
  stylesheet) add the time left to a sale that has an end: the campaign banner's countdown markup and script
  (assets/won-discounts-blocks.js), loaded only then.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign ov = product.metafields['$app:won_discounts'].outlet.value
  assign d = ov.d
  assign show = false
  assign tx_key = 'tx_' | append: request.locale.iso_code | downcase
  assign tx = app.metafields.won_discounts[tx_key].value
  assign t_badge = 'outlet.badge' | t
  assign t_badge = tx['outlet.badge'] | default: t_badge
  assign won_timed = false
  if app.metafields.won_discounts.storefront_config.value.appearance.oc == 1 and ov.e != blank
    assign won_timed = true
    assign won_ends = 'campaign.ends' | t
    assign won_ends = tx['campaign.ends'] | default: won_ends
    assign won_units = 'campaign.units' | t
    assign won_units = tx['campaign.units'] | default: won_units
  endif
  if d == 'strike_badge' or d == 'strike_badge_left'
    assign show = true
  endif
  assign won_picked = product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id
  assign won_many = false
  if product.variants.size > 1
    assign won_many = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if show and ov.v != blank -%}
  <div class="won-outlet" data-won-discounts-outlet>
    {%- for v in product.variants -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign key = v.id | append: ''
        assign left = ov.v[key]
      -%}
      {%- if left != nil -%}
        {%- assign left = left | plus: 0 -%}
        <p class="won-outlet__row" data-won-discounts-outlet-variant="{{ v.id }}"{% if won_many and v.id != won_picked %} hidden{% endif %}>
          <span class="won-outlet__badge" data-won-discounts-outlet-badge>{{ t_badge | escape }}</span>
          {%- if d == 'strike_badge_left' and left > 0 -%}
            <span class="won-outlet__left" data-won-discounts-outlet-left>{{ 'outlet.left' | t: count: left }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if won_timed and ov.e[key] != nil -%}
            <span class="won-outlet__time" data-won-discounts-campaign data-text="" data-ends="{{ won_ends | escape }}" data-units="{{ won_units | escape }}" hidden>
              <script type="application/json">[{"n":"","s":0,"e":{{ ov.e[key] | plus: 0 }}}]</script>
              <span class="won-campaign__title" hidden></span>
              <span class="won-campaign__time" aria-live="off"></span>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- if won_timed or won_many -%}
    <script src="{{ 'won-discounts-blocks.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Sale badge",
  "target": "section",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product"]
  },
  "stylesheet": "won-discounts-outlet.css",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
